| theDotNetWay | 1 | 1.06 | 1.04 | 0/16 | 1.09 |
| theDotNetWay | 2 | 1.05 | 1.05 | 0/16 | 1.08 |
| theDotNetWay | 3 | 1.05 | 1.05 | 0/16 | 1.08 |

